<title>DENMARK: Denmark's KommuneKredit ups 4 pct 2004 bond amount.</title>
<headline>Denmark's KommuneKredit ups 4 pct 2004 bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's KommuneKredit raised an existing four-percent bond due 2004 by 30 million crowns ($4.5 million) to 511 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>Raaschou said the lead manager was Jyske Bank and the bonds were already sold.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
<p>($ = 6.683 Danish Crowns)</p>
</text>
